    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agora — WhatsApp → enlace checkout\n\n### Entradas (usa una)\n- **Manual**: pin data o vacío; usa `AGORA_DEMO_CART_ID`, `AGORA_STORE_ID` (UUID `core.stores`) y `WHAPI_DEMO_TO`.\n- **Webhook POST** `/webhook/agora-checkout-link`: JSON con `integration_cart_id`, `store_id`, `contact_phone`, opcional `message_type`, `conversation_id`.\n- **Execute Workflow**: mismo JSON que envía el flujo padre.\n\nEl **POST …/link** usa body `{\"ttlSeconds\":604800}` solamente; el API deriva la ruta del `store_id` del carrito. No enviar `path` salvo que quieras `/carrito/integracion`.\n\n### Mensajes (`message_type`)\n`default` | `abandoned` | `review` | `human_handoff`\n\n### Env\n`AGORA_API_BASE` (sin `/api`), credencial **Header Auth** con el header del webhook de integración, `WHAPI_MESSAGES_BASE`, token Whapi por credencial (no en JSON).\n\n### Idempotencia\nEvita re-disparos: en el padre, tras enviar enlace, guarda `checkout_link_sent_at` en tu estado (Redis/DB) y no llames otra vez la misma acción para el mismo `integration_cart_id` en ventana corta.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 480,
        "color": "#D5E8FF"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-520, 200],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "note-main",
      "name": "Nota: diseño"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Une Manual ({}), Webhook ({ body, headers }), Execute Workflow (items del padre)\nconst item = $input.first().json;\nconst b = item.body !== undefined ? item.body : item;\n\nconst cartId =\n  b.integration_cart_id ??\n  item.integration_cart_id ??\n  $env.AGORA_DEMO_CART_ID ??\n  '';\n\nconst storeIdRaw =\n  b.store_id ??\n  b.storeId ??\n  item.store_id ??\n  item.storeId ??\n  $env.AGORA_STORE_ID ??\n  '';\n\nlet phone =\n  b.contact_phone ??\n  item.contact_phone ??\n  $env.WHAPI_DEMO_TO ??\n  '';\n\nconst messageType =\n  (b.message_type ?? item.message_type ?? 'default').toString();\n\nconst conversationId =\n  (b.conversation_id ?? item.conversation_id ?? '').toString();\n\nconst escalateOnError = b.escalate_on_error !== false;\n\nfunction normalizeMxPhone(raw) {\n  const d = String(raw || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  if (!d) return '';\n  if (d.startsWith('52') && d.length >= 12) return d;\n  if (d.length === 10) return '52' + d;\n  if (d.length === 11 && d.startsWith('1')) return '52' + d.slice(1);\n  return d;\n}\n\nphone = normalizeMxPhone(phone);\n\nconst integration_cart_id = String(cartId).trim();\nconst store_id = String(storeIdRaw).trim();\nconst valid = Boolean(integration_cart_id && phone && store_id);\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      integration_cart_id,\n      store_id,\n      contact_phone: phone,\n      message_type: messageType,\n      conversation_id: conversationId,\n      escalate_on_error: escalateOnError,\n      valid,\n    },\n  },\n];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [320, 520],
      "id": "code-preparar-contexto",
      "name": "Code: preparar contexto"
    },
