      "id": "http-post-link",
      "name": "POST: Generar link (API Agora)",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Body JSON sin path y con phone (contact_phone). El API arma /sucursal/... desde el carrito y genera sesión automática por magic link. Credencial Header Auth: nombre del header X-Webhook-Secret (mismo valor que en Postman), no solo Bearer salvo que así lo tengas en Agora.",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_AGORA_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Agora API - Webhook Secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const http = $input.first().json;\nconst status = http.statusCode ?? 500;\nlet body = http.body;\nif (typeof body === 'string') {\n  try {\n    body = JSON.parse(body);\n  } catch {\n    body = {};\n  }\n}\nif (!body || typeof body !== 'object') body = {};\n\nconst ctx = $('Code: preparar contexto').first().json;\n\nconst url = body.data?.url ?? body.url ?? '';\nconst successFlag = body.success === true && typeof url === 'string' && url.length > 0;\nconst api_ok = status >= 200 && status < 300 && successFlag;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...ctx,\n      api_status: status,\n      api_ok,\n      checkout_url: url,\n      api_message: body.message || body.error || '',\n      raw_body: body,\n    },\n  },\n];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1040, 420],
      "id": "code-interpretar-api",
      "name": "Code: interpretar respuesta API"
